<title>UK: SBC Jersey reopens Aug 2002 bond with 50 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>SBC Jersey reopens Aug 2002 bond with 50 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBC JERSEY BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT  **50 MLN SFR    COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    23.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.75     PAY DATE   *07.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   28.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTES    **ISSUE NOW TOTALS 300.5 MLN SFR</p>
<p>	     *PLUS 194 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
